# Build artifacts
**/bin/
**/obj/
*.dll
*.pdb
*.exe
*.deps.json
*.runtimeconfig.json
*.assets
*.manifest

# Game-side (never commit)
game source/
Library/
Temp/
Logs/
UserSettings/

# Misc
*.bak
*.orig
*.log
